sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant A as auth-service
    participant M as member-service

    U->>A: GET /register (open the registration page)
    A-->>U: 200 register page
    U->>A: POST /register (first name, last name, email, phone, password)

    alt over the rate limit
        A-->>U: 429 Too Many Requests
    else input is invalid (name, email, phone, password size)
        A-->>U: 400 Bad Request
    else input is valid
        A->>A: normalize email
        A->>A: check password policy (15 to 64 characters)
        alt password is rejected
            A-->>U: 400 Invalid password
        else password is accepted
            A->>A: hash password (SHA-256 then BCrypt)
            A->>A: save member (email must be unique)
            alt email already registered
                A-->>U: 409 Member Already Exist
            else saved
                Note over A: after the save, call member-service through the Feign client (never the password or its hash)
                A->>M: POST /members (email, phone, first name, last name)
                alt member-service creates the member
                    M->>M: create member in its own database
                    M-->>A: 201
                    A-->>U: 200 User Registered
                else member-service answers 409
                    M-->>A: 409
                    A->>A: undo registration (delete saved member)
                    A-->>U: 409 Member Already Exist
                else member-service answers 503 or does not answer
                    M--xA: 503 / timeout
                    A->>A: undo registration (delete saved member)
                    A-->>U: 503 Registration is temporarily unavailable
                else member-service fails otherwise (for example 500)
                    M-->>A: 500
                    A->>A: undo registration (delete saved member)
                    A-->>U: 500 Something went wrong
                end
            end
        end
    end
    Note over A,M: a failed call to member-service fails the registration, the member is not kept
